# A short story in sentence syntax alone.
# It tidies the screen, sends the letters out one at a time, and ends
# differently depending on which way you go.

clear the screen
draw a line
say in the middle A winter night
draw a line

say slowly The door opened slowly.
wait 1 second
say very slowly Outside there was nobody at all.

say in a box Will you step out?
ask answer yes or no

if answer equals yes
    say slowly Snow was falling without a sound.
    start the timer
    put door on cooldown for 2 seconds
    wait for door
    say slowly The door closed behind you.
else
    say slowly You closed the door again.
    say slowly And nothing happened until morning.
end

draw a line
say in the middle The end
draw a line
